---
import Layout from '../layouts/layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us">
	<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8 py-32 relative bg-slate-50">
		<div class="mb-20 text-center">
			<h1 class="text-5xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 mb-6">Built for the real world.</h1>
			<p class="text-xl text-slate-700 max-w-2xl mx-auto">We engineer software that operates flawlessly when the stakes are highest.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="space-y-10 text-lg text-slate-800">
			<p>
				<strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">RMG TECHNOLOGIES INC</strong> was founded on a simple principle: software should be built for high stakes. Whether it's a financial trading algorithm executing in milliseconds, or a defense system that absolutely cannot fail, we engineer for reliability.
			</p>
			<p>
				We do not build bloated software. We build lean, secure, and fast applications. From complex military-grade systems to the day-to-day tools that keep modern businesses running, our baseline is always the same: it must work.
			</p>
			
			<div class="mt-16 bg-white border border-slate-200 p-10 rounded-3xl relative overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Our Philosophy</h2>
				<p class="text-slate-800">
					We believe that the best technology is the technology you don't have to think about. It just works.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>